Subject: [PATCH] Bound dynamic Worker memory and report fatal OOM identity

Coworkerd v33, depends on v27 resource invalidation and v28 quarantine. Fixed upstream v1.20261012.1. Configure public isolate parameters and callbacks in our server limit enforcer; upstream retains only library dependency hooks.

